data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_G\\)</span> (name valuation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (ordinal and name predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}name\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\dot x\\in V^P_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall M,\\Gamma,\\leq_P,G\\;\n(\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G)\\to\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\\in V_\\alpha)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}name\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\dot x\\in V^P_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall M,\\Gamma,\\leq_P,G\\;\n(\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G)\\to\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\\in V_\\alpha)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both the theory parameter of the forcing setup and the forcing-poset parameter of name valuation are explicit.</li>\n<li>No class-sized family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\check V_\\delta:\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\}\">\\(\\{\\check V_\\delta:\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\}\\)</span> is treated as a set or claimed to enumerate all hereditarily nameable objects.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-name","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,G)$ (typed forcing setup, see [[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\dot x,M,\\Gamma,\\leq_P,G,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"V^P_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,P,\\leq_P,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}name\\text{-}collapse}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\n\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\dot x\\in V^P_\\alpha\n\\land\\forall M,\\Gamma,\\leq_P,G\\;\n(\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,G)\\to\\operatorname{val}_{G,P}(\\dot x)\\in V_\\alpha)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\check V_\\delta:\\delta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1318,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4325","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-name-collapse.md|58-thm-name